insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$crop_management_aqi_climate.txt$kc$, $kc$Timing of field operations: When AQI is in the Moderate to Poor range (101–300), farm workers engaged in labour-intensive outdoor tasks face cumulative respiratory exposure risk. Best practice is to schedule strenuous tasks (manual weeding, harvesting, transplanting) during early morning hours (before 10 AM) when photochemical ozone has not yet built up, and surface temperature inversions from the night are breaking up, briefly improving air quality. Midday and afternoon outdoor work during high-ozone days is the highest-risk period.$kc$, '[-0.037355,-0.007282,0.033522,0.001075,0.056228,0.012423,0.061643,0.005149,-0.032879,0.016810,-0.001851,-0.062410,0.031511,0.086818,0.006659,0.020455,-0.010697,0.006096,-0.015723,-0.000174,0.009225,0.010080,-0.015704,-0.071475,0.035733,0.034570,-0.058554,-0.017729,-0.022989,-0.168746,-0.026513,0.005621,0.039068,-0.003417,0.004442,-0.037088,0.006597,0.061641,-0.015054,0.044648,0.035577,0.002723,-0.007471,-0.071193,-0.073512,-0.043333,-0.029155,-0.018528,0.035451,-0.051956,0.025237,-0.030719,0.000018,0.025068,0.035032,-0.024051,0.092455,0.047310,0.010417,0.029374,0.005396,0.040367,-0.206698,0.071562,0.064805,0.024331,-0.019066,-0.023875,0.020213,0.008551,-0.064561,0.030577,-0.014090,0.041507,0.034286,0.025657,-0.025918,-0.077821,0.000829,0.011590,0.010130,-0.019837,-0.040887,-0.006003,-0.008408,-0.019496,0.018027,-0.035907,0.040950,0.012557,-0.014864,-0.061593,-0.052398,0.003607,-0.002385,0.008995,0.024090,-0.001118,-0.079495,0.248917,-0.071472,0.024807,-0.013827,-0.014453,-0.011042,-0.018240,-0.058034,-0.059769,-0.036837,0.033964,0.008464,0.007760,0.042497,-0.046747,0.015361,0.069607,0.055205,0.041690,-0.029300,0.025668,0.009875,0.045150,0.037195,0.002382,0.033756,-0.074605,0.064671,0.119501,0.020750,0.050287,0.086236,-0.053234,0.011646,-0.031573,-0.013050,0.001388,-0.008524,0.011195,-0.002954,-0.016772,-0.009136,-0.0