insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$crop_management_aqi_climate.txt$kc$, $kc$Irrigation decisions: High-temperature days that coincide with elevated AQI are often accompanied by low relative humidity, increasing evapotranspiration demand. Supplemental irrigation during heat-stress events (above 35°C for wheat, 38°C for other crops) can provide cooling benefit by increasing canopy humidity. However, over-irrigation on already-waterlogged soils following intense rainfall events can cause root anoxia and disease pressure.

Fertilisation under pollution stress: Crops exposed to high ozone concentrations show altered nitrogen use efficiency. Chronic ozone stress reduces the amount of photosynthate available to drive root uptake and assimilation. This can make split nitrogen application (smaller doses at more frequent intervals) more effective than single large applications, as it avoids nitrogen waste when plant uptake capacity is suppressed by pollution damage.$kc$, '[-0.035965,0.014753,0.065327,0.020872,0.076040,0.010656,0.064450,0.024090,-0.032064,-0.017416,-0.016225,-0.085950,0.068223,0.044680,-0.003883,0.030015,-0.006226,0.013306,-0.053839,0.031932,0.042211,0.016181,-0.001024,-0.071844,0.019978,0.029537,-0.038748,-0.017979,-0.035671,-0.197069,0.001266,0.011743,0.061479,-0.001588,-0.011989,-0.034840,-0.011231,0.038518,-0.013084,0.036370,0.053230,0.006229,-0.037355,-0.044368,-0.061450,-0.069606,-0.009357,-0.013792,0.034885,-0.053420,0.049234,-0.030197,-0.001815,0.010637,0.018719,0.016411,0.078278,0.088838,-0.000994,0.030739,0.030856,0.028568,-0.218245,0.057343,0.071580,0.004218,-0.021710,-0.036412,0.017133,0.012821,-0.054992,0.064155,0.008869,0.057681,0.028325,-0.018411,-0.041412,-0.056277,0.007205,-0.003545,0.022728,-0.027050,-0.037685,-0.021104,0.006343,-0.062667,-0.009024,-0.074482,0.050153,-0.025968,-0.022711,-0.058775,-0.003781,-0.008316,-0.030966,0.021613,-0.009016,-0.027850,-0.102985,0.250196,-0.095715,0.006977,-0.038462,0.013566,0.003939,-0.007235,-0.032150,-0.050243,-0.016904,0.030043,0.024214,-0.006478,0.019856,0.011351,-0.013930,0.027788,0.058265,0.004575,-0.058974,0.037801,0.008095,0.008682,0.026126,0.013541,0.049038,-0.053868,0.034095,0.144659,0.008312,0.029824,0.057067,-0.066816,-0.009845,-0.018274,-0.013026,0.017739,0.024546,-0.002095,-0.005537,-0.000452,-0.033375,-0.069785,0.007679,-0.171733,-0.013676,0.116339,-0.030603,0.025823,-0.012421,-0.024652,-0.043185,0.096168,-0.010725,0.003669,0.063645,0.018666,-0.021519,0.074054,0.010864,0.015231,-0.008859,-0.022942,-0.06624