insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$crop_management_aqi_climate.txt$kc$, $kc$Crop selection responses to local AQI patterns: Farmers in high-ozone zones may benefit from selecting cultivars bred for ozone tolerance, particularly for wheat (varieties with high antioxidant enzyme expression show measurably lower yield penalties under ozone stress). For areas with chronic PM from industrial or traffic sources, selecting varieties with smoother, waxy leaf surfaces reduces PM deposition and the associated light-interception penalty.

Monitoring integration: Combining real-time AQI data (from CPCB CAAQMS stations or low-cost sensors) with hyperlocal weather forecasting allows proactive scheduling of pesticide spray operations on lower-wind, lower-AQI days, reducing both worker exposure and spray drift losses.$kc$, '[-0.051625,0.022889,0.006476,0.042407,0.083430,0.022384,0.055713,0.063936,-0.054557,0.005588,-0.021063,-0.070852,0.031654,0.061524,0.007909,0.039052,-0.000220,0.009762,-0.031884,0.011030,-0.001499,-0.010881,-0.033600,-0.082839,0.053894,0.042813,-0.037253,-0.022581,-0.036704,-0.191098,-0.002383,0.014067,0.043575,0.003342,-0.023468,-0.029351,0.008621,0.037681,-0.014495,0.029797,0.058267,0.004425,-0.012282,-0.042249,-0.080744,-0.056550,-0.008514,0.015107,-0.008386,-0.075741,0.053958,-0.027741,0.011569,0.007642,0.013337,0.015054,0.053159,0.058302,0.017884,0.015129,0.004511,0.043961,-0.207664,0.064604,0.060764,0.035243,-0.018086,0.002126,0.031011,-0.005743,-0.056279,0.041705,0.011642,0.034729,0.011586,0.000414,-0.032759,-0.056119,-0.001620,0.007069,0.009873,-0.010542,-0.070114,-0.026732,-0.003915,-0.040198,-0.004562,-0.040402,0.078413,-0.021622,-0.026127,-0.090265,-0.032274,-0.030182,-0.030595,-0.023423,0.019307,-0.044331,-0.072562,0.231505,-0.088151,-0.003533,-0.055530,-0.022756,-0.004858,-0.038568,-0.065163,-0.065454,-0.030204,0.036771,0.029727,-0.003473,0.019750,0.002718,-0.021563,0.018267,0.036672,0.016866,0.004321,0.019548,0.014217,0.044767,0.015744,0.012459,0.062347,-0.059483,0.018610,0.145918,0.024773,0.034856,0.065213,-0.047845,-0.040389,-0.029322,-0.016088,0.011976,0.014491,0.005015,-0.009837,0.003284,-0.046405,-0.065005,0.037840,-0.126790,-0.026477,0.130593,-0.023289,0.038577,-0.028355,-0.071235,-0.050814,0.084204,-0.013018,-0.001612,0.048541,0.066521,-0.009443,0.076335,0.019717,0.057276,-0.024197,-0.017367,-0.021090,0.126862,0.008156,-0.080537,-0.031877,0.003473,0.048262,-0.008162,0.034174,0.013543,-0.008970,-0.002995,0.060697,0.025851,-0.059822,0.030961,0.020546,0.028195,0.04518