insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$heat_stress_crop_thresholds.txt$kc$, $kc$For maize, the critical threshold for pollen shedding and silk emergence is around 35°C during flowering. Maize is particularly vulnerable to 2–3 day heat events during the narrow 1–2 week window of pollination. For cotton and soybean, sustained temperatures above 38–40°C during flowering reduce fruit/pod set.

Management options for heat stress include early planting (shifting sensitive stages away from peak heat months), selecting heat-tolerant varieties, and supplemental irrigation before/during critical stages (which cools the canopy and increases humidity around flowers).$kc$, '[-0.027986,-0.002900,0.072244,-0.008098,0.063160,0.038158,0.066993,0.003182,-0.006855,-0.014458,0.008984,-0.072939,0.041908,0.042632,0.008420,0.014538,0.032220,0.051390,-0.029984,0.014996,0.075469,-0.019313,-0.012469,-0.065297,-0.008497,0.005104,-0.023403,0.023484,-0.031914,-0.179519,0.007562,-0.016768,0.036827,-0.002111,-0.019029,-0.044013,-0.021616,0.019214,-0.051486,0.007062,0.068203,0.008835,-0.023422,-0.058913,-0.065964,-0.037543,-0.038215,0.053136,0.040008,-0.054758,0.001804,-0.023417,0.026362,0.026989,0.012678,0.055955,0.089895,0.030898,0.009522,0.041282,-0.004180,0.017810,-0.203958,0.038450,0.064956,-0.011709,-0.041899,-0.048360,0.027492,0.023264,-0.041232,0.052411,-0.021140,0.061993,0.027928,-0.023706,-0.008651,-0.060473,0.001551,0.044794,-0.039322,-0.029878,-0.008805,-0.040037,-0.010840,-0.067606,-0.004797,-0.033853,0.009178,-0.013368,-0.037839,-0.040069,-0.056724,0.003819,-0.036869,0.026184,0.033651,-0.004764,-0.059784,0.255768,-0.071745,-0.004197,-0.021078,-0.006269,0.002909,-0.047790,-0.029510,-0.050599,-0.029866,0.027095,0.039674,-0.026168,0.022893,0.010877,0.056079,-0.029061,0.076196,-0.019036,-0.019230,0.043538,0.023327,0.062555,0.062135,-0.005471,0.043035,-0.068819,0.009383,0.141965,0.011670,0.019852,0.082904,-0.026637,-0.018648,-0.063009,-0.010460,-0.020813,0.008218,0.012115,0.024743,-0.010099,-0.036214,-0.131383,0.033847,-0.147255,0.018411,0.091172,-0.024874,0.035183,-0.050672,-0.010921,-0.034533,0.033211,-0.028852,-0.045145,0.067670,0.052167,-0.017033,0.087361,0.028091,0.012486,-0.008544,0.023230,-0.005919,0.067739,0.034137,-0.054377,-0.014684,0.038027,-0.021819,-0.014161,0.052567,0.002981,-0.037069,-0.025643,0.065142,-0.023564,-0.045769,-0.003844,0.020733,0.035968,0.057933,