insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$india_cpcb_standards.txt$kc$, $kc$Reference: India CPCB National Ambient Air Quality Standards (NAAQS), notified under Environment (Protection) Act 1986, revised 2009

India's Central Pollution Control Board (CPCB) sets National Ambient Air Quality Standards that define legally permissible concentration limits for outdoor air pollutants. These standards apply to all industrial, residential, rural, and sensitive zones, though specific sensitive areas like hospitals and schools have tighter limits.

For PM2.5, the CPCB annual mean standard is 40 µg/m³ and the 24-hour standard is 60 µg/m³. Sensitive areas (hospitals, schools) are held to 20 µg/m³ annually and 30 µg/m³ daily. These thresholds are considerably more permissive than WHO guidelines — the Indian annual standard is 8 times higher than WHO's 5 µg/m³ — reflecting India's development stage and the difficulty of achieving tighter limits across a large population.$kc$, '[-0.038233,0.009333,0.033613,0.002579,0.010713,0.027822,0.072995,0.040108,0.002815,0.030894,-0.010432,-0.090189,0.041912,0.059208,0.025291,0.033555,0.028747,0.003048,0.008844,0.068116,0.050224,0.005181,-0.018053,-0.077407,0.020279,0.042691,-0.043378,-0.056231,-0.037673,-0.187175,0.000838,-0.033225,0.056552,-0.008607,-0.026050,-0.034658,-0.017010,0.020955,0.006484,0.055093,0.001012,0.011232,0.038471,-0.057806,-0.039737,-0.052126,-0.042865,0.013151,0.012289,-0.067309,0.031586,-0.038748,-0.012083,0.080923,0.004796,0.000939,0.040834,0.015856,0.071370,0.013791,0.015126,0.062974,-0.233871,0.075946,0.063053,0.034654,-0.033267,0.001238,0.051642,0.006688,-0.060815,0.019412,0.039108,0.049038,-0.010505,0.001988,-0.058525,-0.027523,-0.019040,-0.032133,-0.014616,-0.040508,-0.042966,-0.032983,0.029106,0.004436,0.007916,-0.048427,0.009848,0.024643,0.006246,-0.072538,-0.013197,0.034853,-0.048730,-0.023523,0.050497,0.022067,-0.039886,0.249208,-0.058188,-0.001631,-0.025492,0.001241,0.019357,-0.039967,0.004699,-0.009857,0.017236,-0.000197,0.033983,-0.020541,0.079429,-0.087250,0.012292,0.018139,0.063765,0.007685,0.001923,-0.030780,-0.026962,0.006514,0.020576,-0.025441,0.058405,-0.056007,0.024147,0.078910,0.015332,0.056846,0.073139,-0.056874,-0.028568,-0.009623,0.021094,0.013691,0.067070,0.013821,0.006762,0.002716,-0.012265,-0.082735,0.020996,-0.121912,-0.047377,0.075663,-0.028490,0.047168,-0.051564,-0.047131,-0.002253,0.070009,-0.067985,-0.011072,0.028740,0.014912,0.031021,0.040684,-0.015762,0.016175,0.016220,-0.047801,-0.029108,0.112963,0.004932,-0.060542,-0.0