insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$india_cpcb_standards.txt$kc$, $kc$For PM10, India's annual mean standard is 60 µg/m³ and the 24-hour standard is 100 µg/m³. Sensitive zones apply 50 µg/m³ and 75 µg/m³ respectively.

For nitrogen dioxide (NO2), the annual mean is 40 µg/m³ and the 24-hour mean is 80 µg/m³. Sensitive areas are pegged at 20 µg/m³ and 40 µg/m³.

For ozone (O3), India's 8-hour standard is 100 µg/m³, compared to WHO's 60 µg/m³. India does not yet enforce an annual ozone standard.

For sulphur dioxide (SO2), the annual mean is 50 µg/m³ and the 24-hour mean is 80 µg/m³.

These standards are enforced through state pollution control boards, which issue consent orders and can impose closure notices on violating industrial units. However, enforcement capacity varies significantly by state, and nonattainment cities — those persistently exceeding standards — are the focus of India's National Clean Air Programme.$kc$, '[-0.020331,-0.010742,0.050458,-0.009411,0.039486,0.009333,0.065068,0.022655,-0.001138,0.002145,-0.008286,-0.087438,0.059477,0.038206,0.006464,0.005228,0.024341,-0.039965,-0.039306,0.049830,0.115829,0.030988,-0.006389,-0.069669,0.025322,0.058372,-0.041444,-0.046633,-0.043911,-0.198346,-0.003439,-0.047416,0.076385,-0.000089,-0.052281,-0.039843,-0.053676,0.032098,0.002832,0.015801,0.012234,0.018039,0.043761,-0.079029,-0.049651,-0.047051,-0.059596,-0.000651,0.003770,-0.088854,0.044366,-0.013874,-0.034538,0.072953,0.028117,0.011839,0.049520,-0.002394,0.079840,0.012106,0.004202,0.054834,-0.225042,0.047451,0.069201,0.012185,-0.013112,-0.007549,0.036194,0.021231,-0.027978,0.017517,0.045193,0.023386,0.009203,0.000753,-0.031379,-0.043501,-0.014928,-0.015996,-0.007305,-0.019123,-0.015878,-0.025482,-0.010697,-0.038969,0.031165,-0.018134,0.024812,0.023862,0.000184,-0.000203,-0.033058,0.030335,-0.030163,-0.004177,0.032654,0.022878,-0.045934,0.233415,-0.050025,-0.006604,-0.005824,-0.013915,0.017300,-0.021144,-0.025846,-0.020775,0.003302,0.007336,0.023538,0.001248,0.074510,-0.060475,0.032077,0.019106,0.072420,0.003846,-0.012567,-0.012959,-0.023281,0.012293,0.008456,-0.025442,0.063994,-0.039378,0.048511,0.078269,0.007251,0.043762,0.035895,-0.063678,-0.039999,-0.011381,0.006986,0.010359,0.038804,-0.005951,0.010520,0.008074,-0.025733,-0.077546,0.009005,-0.096561,-0.046753,0.113217,-0.021873,0.014217,-0.020966,-0.031200,-0.006177,0.046166,-0.078894,-0.040720,0.065699,0.037775,0.026611,0.042956,-0.032006,0.001438,0.007310,-0.043126,-0.055461,0.089643,0.030722,-0.052722,-0.049707,0.018514,-0.010177,0.014654,0.021015,0.046330,-0.031017,0.012231,0.