insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$india_ncap_overview.txt$kc$, $kc$Reference: India National Clean Air Programme (NCAP), launched January 2019, MoEFCC

India's National Clean Air Programme (NCAP) was launched by the Ministry of Environment, Forest and Climate Change (MoEFCC) in January 2019 as the country's first national air quality improvement initiative. It operates under a time-bound framework targeting measurable reductions in particulate matter concentrations.

The original target was a 20–30% reduction in PM2.5 and PM10 concentrations by 2024 compared to 2017 baseline levels. In 2022, the government revised this target upward to a 40% reduction by 2026, signalling stronger policy ambition. The programme identifies 131 non-attainment cities — urban areas that have consistently exceeded CPCB NAAQS for more than five years based on ambient air quality monitoring data.$kc$, '[-0.072901,-0.006406,0.037510,-0.018907,0.027558,0.045623,0.041097,0.034009,-0.018449,-0.011376,0.021362,-0.079496,0.036241,0.034138,0.021398,0.003282,0.001884,-0.013594,0.010738,0.025683,0.061058,0.001305,-0.002071,-0.055270,0.067870,0.031305,-0.020235,-0.092718,-0.046053,-0.183409,-0.022163,-0.033874,0.054461,0.009480,-0.037814,-0.034407,-0.019805,0.071566,-0.001691,0.033551,0.022499,-0.015142,0.003033,-0.050529,-0.026146,-0.031543,-0.005593,-0.003761,-0.006516,-0.073268,0.043760,-0.062282,-0.026558,0.027299,0.027995,0.010198,0.015020,0.007415,0.060490,0.058082,0.017201,0.083052,-0.285129,0.105903,0.056205,0.012922,-0.006089,-0.036836,0.062305,0.001111,-0.047326,0.055371,0.015027,0.032200,0.000172,0.005389,-0.028255,-0.009444,-0.011292,-0.017619,0.018266,0.003191,-0.037467,-0.031960,0.005491,-0.035910,-0.010236,-0.055527,0.013745,0.016417,-0.008286,-0.041284,0.006423,0.019566,-0.066304,-0.002667,0.059484,0.020443,-0.076621,0.223585,-0.091921,0.007746,-0.013721,-0.000805,0.004149,-0.030276,-0.015802,-0.054544,0.007193,-0.051204,0.023941,-0.016040,0.063428,-0.067892,0.026858,0.056957,0.074211,0.007147,-0.020280,0.001517,-0.008935,0.002528,0.037195,-0.043269,0.023118,-0.039409,0.021699,0.087144,-0.005281,0.013013,0.063516,-0.030797,-0.061115,-0.033488,0.012240,0.025580,0.030854,0.005947,-0.015565,0.038010,-0.018216,-0.078174,0.003633,-0.134446,-0.053114,0.093518,-0.031021,-0.006481,-0.061191,-0.029056,0.000139,0.075495,-0.041303,-0.015650,0.020363,0.001695,0.051361,0.072231,0.003518,0.034760,-0.005435,-0.061578,-0.053126,0.076114,0.029734,-0.116849,-0.0423