insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$india_ncap_overview.txt$kc$, $kc$NCAP allocates funds to these cities through the 15th Finance Commission grants, which are tied to demonstrated improvements in air quality metrics. Cities must submit City Action Plans detailing sector-specific emission reduction strategies covering transport, construction dust, industrial pollution, waste burning, and domestic solid-fuel combustion.

Key implementation elements include expanding the air quality monitoring network (CAAQMS — continuous ambient air quality monitoring stations), strengthening real-time data sharing on the SAMEER portal, and improving emission inventories. The programme emphasises source apportionment studies to identify which sectors contribute most to PM pollution in each city, as this varies significantly — Delhi's pollution is heavily shaped by vehicles and seasonal stubble burning, while Ahmedabad has large industrial contributions.$kc$, '[-0.053410,-0.007581,0.037421,0.016039,-0.000475,0.033489,0.040793,0.023540,-0.025659,0.005517,0.005793,-0.097215,0.018722,0.036294,0.032675,-0.005557,-0.007190,0.001205,0.037571,0.008279,0.003552,-0.004393,-0.023143,-0.045313,0.050584,0.071803,-0.021358,-0.077004,-0.031549,-0.191408,-0.007619,-0.047035,0.039502,-0.022644,-0.021412,-0.025609,-0.038558,0.068101,-0.059194,0.032537,0.034061,0.003571,-0.007372,-0.084292,-0.036945,-0.044265,-0.005733,0.013715,-0.009136,-0.079478,0.059616,-0.090939,-0.014253,0.050262,0.014902,0.004163,0.042437,0.033853,0.045674,0.043725,0.021530,0.067543,-0.261681,0.060540,0.060136,0.005535,-0.019033,-0.021668,0.054069,0.034764,-0.051972,0.029275,0.021925,0.047596,0.024185,0.021150,-0.031323,-0.043895,-0.020764,-0.007241,0.012717,-0.018431,-0.005216,0.004818,0.020335,-0.026157,-0.013334,-0.054194,0.029396,-0.007388,0.002523,-0.033224,-0.032402,0.005182,-0.075893,-0.012628,0.041218,0.015463,-0.038540,0.260779,-0.041993,-0.017295,-0.027385,-0.008867,0.039865,-0.027855,-0.037611,-0.033619,0.021950,0.017564,0.004071,-0.023844,0.029725,-0.036279,-0.022256,0.035775,0.053276,0.039857,-0.044094,-0.028882,-0.010454,-0.008797,0.048482,-0.018636,0.047598,-0.048905,0.030675,0.075484,0.012239,0.065761,0.062187,-0.015597,-0.057024,-0.005666,0.007853,-0.008416,0.030458,0.005398,0.004154,0.032785,-0.002411,-0.035674,-0.001393,-0.133342,-0.036251,0.086603,-0.042657,0.010085,-0.059702,-0.017931,-0.008166,0.063002,-0.020887,-0.022175,0