insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$north_india_seasonal_aqi.txt$kc$, $kc$Reference: SAFAR (System of Air Quality and Weather Forecasting and Research), TERI research on stubble burning, IIT Delhi AQI studies

North India experiences two major seasonal AQI spikes that are well-documented and predictable: the post-harvest stubble burning season (October–November) and the Diwali festival period (October–November, overlapping with stubble burning).

Paddy stubble burning occurs primarily in Punjab and Haryana after the kharif (monsoon) rice harvest, typically between mid-October and mid-November. Farmers burn the leftover crop residue to clear fields quickly for the subsequent Rabi wheat sowing, which must happen within a narrow window. The fires release large quantities of PM2.5, PM10, carbon monoxide, and ozone precursors. Satellite fire count data from NASA MODIS regularly shows thousands of active fire pixels in this region during the peak burning period.$kc$, '[-0.058469,0.029535,0.023032,0.010875,0.056624,0.023663,0.047970,0.032916,-0.028852,0.002795,-0.008815,-0.082422,0.040780,0.076004,0.015801,0.002004,-0.004419,-0.029356,0.018909,-0.021955,0.044622,-0.010308,-0.020782,-0.087807,0.045552,0.038890,-0.044354,-0.076737,-0.072619,-0.197907,0.025154,0.009112,0.049348,-0.032346,0.013807,-0.026358,-0.009544,0.068636,-0.034080,0.006866,0.016604,0.001308,0.034697,-0.070365,-0.048584,-0.061215,-0.057753,-0.015888,0.016088,-0.067630,0.007719,-0.046037,0.026116,0.019317,0.002821,-0.014866,0.030959,0.052172,0.035850,0.046630,0.000522,0.055965,-0.225334,0.085381,0.043491,-0.030219,0.001465,-0.017607,0.022975,-0.020071,-0.053558,0.073238,0.008784,0.039072,0.024552,0.009580,-0.018138,0.005760,-0.042560,-0.012547,-0.003150,0.005099,-0.034998,-0.044474,-0.001025,-0.038036,-0.001174,-0.046129,0.029031,0.012465,-0.004094,-0.060786,-0.018445,0.003859,-0.087910,0.008786,0.030624,0.004972,-0.015887,0.225839,-0.081003,-0.013046,-0.029830,-0.007895,-0.007128,-0.043152,-0.043904,-0.036753,-0.019353,0.024986,0.015020,0.011376,0.000575,-0.032260,0.030521,-0.037790,0.085419,0.036821,-0.055918,0.005744,0.002966,0.033000,0.063294,-0.034865,0.063341,-0.039910,0.023612,0.132147,-0.002921,0.021814,0.057783,-0.059847,-0.064497,-0.037583,-0.002126,-0.017667,0.036068,-0.018534,0.010981,-0.031996,-0.025044,-0.096972,0.024354,-0.087978,-0.030156,0.063270,-0.018186,-0.022213,-0.044631,-0.041739,-0.018642,0.059406,-0.044286,-0.010989,0.079800