-0.060955,0.011568,0.042693,-0.018378,0.028198,-0.016735,0.034375,-0.011260,0.045085,-0.062745,-0.046111,-0.024163,0.015527,0.021562,-0.014141,-0.043339,-0.027313,0.059750]');
insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$north_india_seasonal_aqi.txt$kc$, $kc$During peak stubble burning events, PM2.5 in Delhi and surrounding regions can reach 500–900 µg/m³ over 24-hour periods — 10 to 18 times India's CPCB NAAQS of 60 µg/m³ and 100–180 times WHO's guideline of 5 µg/m³. The pollution from Punjab and Haryana is transported to Delhi and the broader Indo-Gangetic Plain within 12–24 hours by north-westerly winds. Atmospheric inversions during autumn (cool nights trapping pollution near the surface) amplify peak concentrations significantly.

The Diwali festival, concentrated in a single night of fireworks, typically adds a sharp 200–400 µg/m³ spike in PM2.5 lasting 6–12 hours in urban centres. When Diwali coincides with peak stubble burning — as it often does given the lunar calendar alignment — combined PM2.5 episodes reach extreme health hazard levels.$kc$, '[-0.048698,0.006626,0.059135,-0.000078,0.018639,0.026463,0.062329,0.018814,-0.028098,0.006287,-0.005619,-0.094296,0.030631,0.045254,-0.001338,0.010501,0.018309,-0.047754,-0.029271,0.020025,0.080359,-0.022425,-0.019385,-0.069810,0.024637,0.055637,-0.036816,-0.042652,-0.042888,-0.198996,0.031558,-0.031140,0.021142,-0.024601,-0.016664,-0.028508,-0.017786,0.069430,-0.009307,0.008327,0.030357,-0.010187,0.013748,-0.083323,-0.061228,-0.074055,-0.066102,-0.008572,0.036208,-0.072873,0.017265,-0.046637,0.016184,0.047932,-0.006972,-0.002137,0.046423,0.013962,0.040638,0.054254,0.001446,0.064887,-0.215877,0.067455,0.067288,-0.009993,-0.038459,-0.009248,0.025657,0.018389,-0.046784,0.058849,0.041457,0.030293,0.008497,0.021034,-0.034615,-0.014955,-0.038887,-0.006476,0.030716,-0.045603,-0.009110,-0.035504,0.010361,-0.049623,-0.005299,-0.033565,0.005079,0.045736,-0.011282,-0.060263,-0.040939,0.012585,-0.065675,-0.005837,0.072338,0.027785,-0.005530,0.234979,-0.078014,-0.035195,-0.037280,0.013051,-0.004480,-0.042474,-0.038191,-0.021920,-0.003285,-0.005631,0.027019,-0.012752,0.049115,-0.031291,0.004006,-0.028212,0.106942,0.044894,-0.080608,-0.008844,0.001297,-0.011159,0.073091,-0.005531,0.060667,-0.034792,0.045420,0.109450,0.011701,0.037947,0.055281,-0.022401,-0.050425,-0.026758,-0.008404,-0.033672,0.037862,-0.034690,0.015322,-0.012375,-0.018686,-0.095004,0.019397,-0.096616,-0.015245,0.067941,-0.004465,-0.007207,-0.031293,-0.043598,-0.025953,0.023402,-0.047988,-0.010857,0.070383,0.036764,0.034892,0.076749,-0.010723,0.003873,0.003611,-0.017274,-0.021055,0.099278,0.055426,-0.051184,-0.039440,0.039835,-0.032267,-0.018025,0.022655,0.022641,-0.029320,0.021994,0.070219,0.02