insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$ozone_crop_yield_effects.txt$kc$, $kc$Reference: Research literature on tropospheric ozone effects on crops, including UNECE/CLRTAP mapping manual and Ainsworth et al. (2012)

Ground-level (tropospheric) ozone is one of the most damaging air pollutants affecting agricultural productivity globally. Unlike PM or NO2, ozone damages crops directly by entering leaf tissue through stomata — the small pores plants use to exchange gases during photosynthesis.

Once inside the leaf, ozone degrades chloroplast membranes and disrupts the biochemical machinery of photosynthesis. It accelerates leaf aging (senescence), reduces the area of functional leaf tissue, and triggers production of reactive oxygen species that interfere with carbon assimilation. The result is reduced dry matter accumulation and ultimately lower grain yield.$kc$, '[-0.050492,-0.018931,0.054755,0.007160,0.092951,0.013936,0.016909,0.043105,-0.038772,0.025797,-0.010242,-0.071342,0.051606,0.066247,-0.016923,-0.023187,-0.003206,0.057947,-0.060638,0.025032,0.046532,0.000800,-0.039188,-0.055004,0.057053,0.048373,-0.061271,-0.029542,-0.071392,-0.171740,-0.017804,0.012991,0.022813,0.046587,-0.018869,-0.033653,0.003382,0.026151,-0.002721,0.031106,0.074567,-0.026499,-0.026934,-0.043554,-0.076214,-0.058720,-0.019336,-0.027446,0.002918,-0.104588,0.048068,-0.006946,-0.015528,0.027661,-0.004146,-0.001642,0.059312,0.083371,0.042727,0.003126,0.048055,0.024378,-0.245435,0.067193,0.085261,0.046322,-0.024463,0.008801,0.039919,0.015292,-0.075194,0.042466,0.031976,0.017143,0.026572,0.003444,-0.052979,-0.089107,-0.014662,-0.006050,0.019773,0.022651,-0.063020,-0.038200,-0.042889,-0.051481,0.005910,-0.059347,0.020552,0.022214,-0.009218,-0.099595,0.042301,0.029160,-0.062692,0.014732,0.025063,-0.039556,-0.051631,0.239432,-0.101207,0.001040,-0.004427,-0.014040,-0.015676,-0.031086,-0.007728,-0.018703,-0.048571,0.078399,0.043791,-0.015117,0.015669,-0.003106,0.027131,-0.007735,0.088189,0.012508,-0.028474,0.009031,-0.012607,0.031402,0.015782,0.038284,0.069852,-0.076309,0.024473,0.148423,0.056397,0.008026,0.063307,-0.068157,-0.019096,-0.021939,-0.015728,0.015104,0.003271,-0.038170,-0.021728,-0.009708,-0.016673,-0.089497,-0.015130,-0.104660,-0.037831,0.148791,0.018879,0.027027,-0.053238,-0.002281,-0.009987,0.052569,-0.001829,-0.000060,0.051534,0.045206,0.001840,0.071133,0.011996,-0.008794,-0.003812,-0.030108,-0.057899,0.107004,0.023577,-0.040864,-0.043004,0.024732,0.034302,-0.007288,0.04