insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$ozone_crop_yield_effects.txt$kc$, $kc$Wheat is the most widely studied ozone-sensitive crop. Field studies and open-top chamber experiments in South Asia suggest that current ambient ozone levels in the Indo-Gangetic Plain (where background concentrations routinely reach 50–80 ppb during the spring wheat season) cause yield losses of 10–30% relative to clean-air controls. Some modelling studies place cumulative losses in India's wheat production at several million tonnes per year.

Rice (paddy) is somewhat less ozone-sensitive than wheat due to partially closed stomata during portions of the day, but is not immune. Ambient ozone levels in the Kharif (June–October) rice growing season in northern and eastern India are typically lower than the spring Rabi season, but elevated ozone still reduces yields by an estimated 5–15% in high-exposure regions.$kc$, '[-0.023858,-0.007086,0.030740,0.018644,0.070817,0.017384,0.032944,0.041459,-0.054853,-0.012432,-0.003359,-0.098408,0.061965,0.060256,-0.000122,0.005522,-0.007684,0.008262,-0.028995,-0.014758,0.053770,0.007136,-0.031781,-0.097863,0.050304,0.053891,-0.021416,-0.038866,-0.048747,-0.163708,-0.012049,-0.021772,0.048288,0.007009,-0.051026,-0.010952,-0.017463,0.036229,-0.010227,0.022739,0.055532,-0.011072,0.024490,-0.044203,-0.089275,-0.050086,-0.034232,-0.012651,-0.012488,-0.106118,0.064784,0.024274,-0.004139,0.052726,-0.018816,-0.012544,0.065378,0.049149,0.047394,0.014945,-0.008127,0.066833,-0.220657,0.049414,0.070598,0.017206,0.022768,-0.032362,0.056691,-0.004027,-0.065495,0.064017,0.030743,0.020710,0.001953,-0.000452,-0.038931,-0.075561,-0.040777,-0.005395,-0.006398,0.022436,-0.042164,-0.009833,-0.034158,-0.072632,0.015562,-0.053544,0.025213,0.010412,-0.027850,-0.084898,0.017740,0.000347,-0.017835,0.017237,0.011489,0.007356,-0.065064,0.242829,-0.083318,0.010013,-0.012925,0.006749,-0.053560,-0.077759,-0.032613,-0.014804,-0.024079,0.045310,0.040691,-0.012551,0.032438,-0.042697,0.020754,-0.000549,0.072929,0.026573,-0.036613,0.015632,0.001309,0.046470,0.014320,0.019537,0.078740,-0.043032,0.002694,0.119038,0.016585,0.013620,0.062333,-0.100554,-0.032595,-0.025144,-0.029672,0.026845,0.009191,-0.020441,-0.026414,0.001998,-0.029026,-0.080927,0.030203,-0.138479,-0.020146,0.118820,-0.000885,0.017668,-0.031694,-0.036241,0.005310,0.082427,-0.004894,-0.013119,0.060482,0.051421,-0.031168,0.089083,0.032927,0.012250,-0.011957,-0.015827,-0.079828,0.102985,0.046973,-0.064124,-0.058407,0.072593,0.036847,0.011600,0.04