insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$ozone_crop_yield_effects.txt$kc$, $kc$Soybean is extremely sensitive to ozone. North American and European research consistently shows 15–30% yield reductions at ozone concentrations of 60–70 ppb sustained over a growing season. Soybean's high stomatal conductance makes it more vulnerable than most cereals.

Agronomic relevance: ozone damage cannot be reversed by irrigation or fertiliser, making it distinct from most other yield stressors. The main management tools are early planting (to shift the sensitive flowering and grain fill period away from peak ozone months) and selection of tolerant varieties. Avoiding irrigated crops during high-ozone daytime hours is sometimes recommended for very sensitive crops.$kc$, '[0.002277,-0.023294,0.048378,-0.023252,0.097787,0.027348,0.035066,0.035187,-0.042553,0.003452,-0.018417,-0.098905,0.070167,0.056423,0.021567,0.008140,0.014987,0.031805,-0.034832,0.015732,0.036995,0.019159,-0.005197,-0.081280,0.037297,0.028622,0.002066,-0.014421,-0.061241,-0.183017,-0.005393,-0.019529,0.018812,0.023809,-0.044899,-0.016235,-0.032226,0.028695,-0.003251,0.038891,0.051475,0.019365,-0.010136,-0.057871,-0.055564,-0.033041,-0.028646,0.000024,0.029129,-0.090933,0.054068,-0.000689,-0.023823,0.024493,0.006507,0.002827,0.086186,0.014271,-0.001565,0.008879,0.003439,0.044230,-0.199241,0.047004,0.083903,0.044468,-0.009685,-0.034523,0.076735,0.018211,-0.061677,0.024975,0.010900,0.026133,0.035176,-0.020390,-0.056237,-0.087381,-0.018055,0.008183,-0.011870,-0.006860,-0.066107,-0.010022,-0.038950,-0.089775,0.019251,-0.042625,0.020025,0.025057,-0.022477,-0.063088,0.016520,0.014868,-0.020570,0.030556,0.002257,-0.009746,-0.076942,0.255231,-0.067994,0.013915,-0.019093,0.005187,-0.005248,-0.072102,-0.002064,-0.030122,-0.066117,0.072130,0.068952,-0.029730,0.044561,-0.028523,-0.006857,0.014723,0.042759,-0.023878,-0.006870,0.014861,-0.007860,0.062738,0.044535,0.028565,0.063202,-0.063993,0.022338,0.112021,0.032288,0.020289,0.039642,-0.077495,-0.018338,-0.018100,-0.028585,0.020130,0.005936,-0.017684,-0.027598,0.025392,-0.027359,-0.096053,-0.001893,-0.147770,-0.015160,0.118321,-0.042508,0.033337,-0.062985,-0.020543,-0.017890,0.040770,-0.001539,-0.048191,0.035152,0.054342,-0.030770,0.064897,0.004166,0.020859,0.010663,-0.007601,-0.057719,0.076381,0.030670,-0.039382,-0.049187