insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$particulate_matter_crop_photosynthesis.txt$kc$, $kc$Reference: Research on particulate matter deposition effects on plant physiology, including Prusty et al. and FAO crop-environmental quality studies

Particulate matter (PM) affects crops through a physical mechanism quite different from gaseous pollutants like ozone. Rather than entering through stomata, particles deposit on the external surfaces of leaves and accumulate over time, particularly during periods of low rainfall or wind.

The primary pathway of impact is light interception. A layer of PM on the upper leaf surface reflects or absorbs incoming solar radiation before it reaches the photosynthetically active cells beneath. Studies on crops near industrial zones and roads have documented photosynthetic rate reductions of 15–40% under heavy PM deposition, directly reducing the plant's ability to fix carbon and build yield.$kc$, '[-0.051644,-0.020495,0.037049,-0.000191,0.073588,0.012785,0.039584,0.025151,-0.053963,0.041145,-0.006595,-0.075071,0.062847,0.042481,0.000022,0.017307,0.020057,0.032363,-0.043630,0.024082,0.030584,-0.022620,-0.029832,-0.048553,0.039870,-0.003161,-0.051528,-0.047352,-0.080952,-0.186880,-0.003661,-0.000350,0.012909,-0.006494,-0.019217,-0.032371,-0.007887,0.045444,-0.019055,0.049297,0.070680,-0.023560,-0.024549,-0.038406,-0.038772,-0.041788,0.007667,0.004380,0.015692,-0.066204,0.016047,-0.052887,0.000074,0.013172,0.003837,0.026468,0.066543,0.061225,0.043236,0.012329,0.007799,0.054554,-0.268125,0.078436,0.099677,0.033888,-0.066026,0.014051,0.068366,0.021639,-0.086824,0.051727,0.013782,0.034022,0.046100,-0.023089,-0.034674,-0.061503,-0.005049,0.003945,0.014968,0.029715,-0.049760,-0.029378,-0.030851,-0.033376,0.009269,-0.068570,0.030875,0.003917,-0.020127,-0.086164,-0.019130,0.034004,-0.093817,0.023785,0.026764,-0.045355,-0.018330,0.222280,-0.100269,-0.000353,-0.009272,0.008339,-0.019009,-0.013557,-0.040041,-0.069729,-0.019998,0.053324,0.045991,-0.005915,0.018403,0.016920,0.059158,-0.011443,0.089769,0.035760,-0.032631,-0.007921,-0.008686,0.044172,0.027314,0.006571,0.053477,-0.066109,0.013147,0.151965,0.014767,0.008232,0.072523,-0.033384,-0.049039,-0.033219,-0.012135,-0.010609,0.025796,-0.023825,-0.012786,0.015691,-0.012056,-0.091232,-0.020466,-0.126407,-0.056546,0.138325,-0.000130,0.032094,-0.027456,-0.015844,-0.017837,0.066348,-0.018239,-0.001062,0.039147,0.050774,0.005469,0.055571,0.040920,0.022849,-0.025396,-0.036327,-0.016063,0.105465,0.026864,-0.041258,-0.033147,0.0