insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$particulate_matter_crop_photosynthesis.txt$kc$, $kc$Stomatal clogging is a secondary mechanism. Fine particles (especially PM2.5 and sub-micron fractions) can physically block or partially obstruct stomatal apertures, impeding both CO2 uptake and transpiration. Reduced transpiration under heat stress is particularly damaging since transpirational cooling is a key mechanism plants use to protect leaf tissue from temperature damage.

Heavy metals carried by industrial PM (lead, cadmium, arsenic, chromium) accumulate in soil over multiple seasons and can be taken up by crop roots. This creates food safety concerns in addition to direct yield impacts. Leafy vegetables and root crops are most vulnerable to direct foliar absorption and uptake via roots respectively.$kc$, '[-0.031879,-0.021606,0.045874,-0.005681,0.096996,-0.028736,0.069204,0.020960,-0.014267,0.013706,-0.016079,-0.076500,0.076552,0.042487,0.016879,0.005569,0.012163,0.040836,-0.043714,-0.013837,0.037900,0.016143,-0.007917,-0.079159,0.020549,0.045752,-0.036685,-0.028136,-0.057900,-0.183933,-0.001422,-0.009848,0.012620,-0.033228,-0.013898,-0.069900,-0.026248,0.058407,-0.020577,0.026569,0.025660,0.010169,-0.007023,-0.066555,-0.055989,-0.048031,-0.019368,0.018286,0.038390,-0.025729,0.031147,-0.026161,-0.022601,0.027847,0.000884,0.027086,0.050028,0.023505,0.038503,0.026046,0.042491,0.033722,-0.228100,0.071822,0.060853,0.036056,-0.043420,0.007758,0.070268,0.043299,-0.042408,0.048904,0.034597,0.002537,0.059230,-0.023642,-0.038416,-0.077065,0.005969,0.046252,0.025085,0.021007,-0.058473,-0.007539,-0.042581,-0.059817,-0.011302,-0.069298,0.031747,0.006845,0.004069,-0.083932,-0.002533,0.015594,-0.063537,0.030311,0.051428,-0.014111,-0.055824,0.241563,-0.056461,0.028242,0.019592,0.027575,-0.007710,0.005498,-0.020207,-0.057675,-0.008337,0.051858,0.039525,-0.031930,0.025482,0.006736,0.040503,-0.029111,0.050216,-0.005571,-0.057924,0.013736,-0.004704,0.043254,0.060407,-0.003227,0.053644,-0.068119,0.012922,0.123347,0.021382,0.039620,0.053435,-0.053727,-0.025155,-0.040053,-0.007598,0.005361,0.004398,-0.004790,-0.003281,-0.014115,-0.028524,-0.116512,-0.025577,-0.153535,-0.028045,0.094588,-0.002396,0.038806,-0.048026,-0.018945,-0.019656,0.028491,0.019112,-0.008850,0.024054,0.051266,0.001085,0.048996,0.030627,0.011610,0.019578,-0.040293,-0.031047,0.085433,0.053368,-0.030453,-0.027130,0.017959,-0.009381,-0.026037,0.032113,0.019749,-0.020745,-0.068930,0.029859