insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$particulate_matter_crop_photosynthesis.txt$kc$, $kc$PM deposition is higher close to roads, industrial zones, and quarries. Wind direction, particle size distribution, and surface characteristics (waxy leaves retain less than rough leaves) all affect deposition rates. Rainfall effectively washes PM off leaf surfaces, which is why crops near pollution sources show the strongest effects during dry spells.

In North India's post-harvest stubble burning season (October–November), PM2.5 concentrations can reach 300–500 µg/m³ for days at a time. While winter crops are not yet at photosynthetically sensitive stages, the suppression of solar radiation reaching the surface (a "brown cloud" effect) can delay germination and establishment of Rabi crops sown in November.$kc$, '[-0.025063,0.008967,0.014392,-0.004982,0.047791,0.035414,0.049562,0.034665,-0.047975,0.025379,0.004289,-0.087353,0.059665,0.043003,-0.010638,0.014785,0.027822,-0.011254,-0.055013,0.018912,0.073179,-0.023732,-0.022036,-0.086254,0.044876,0.024841,-0.054984,-0.041203,-0.048702,-0.217836,0.029551,-0.006843,0.015264,-0.038788,-0.023150,-0.024142,-0.003339,0.045454,-0.034906,-0.017839,0.017000,0.007343,0.002952,-0.067604,-0.046033,-0.032536,-0.013314,0.002176,0.028552,-0.090313,0.035612,-0.050636,-0.007101,0.014628,0.028897,0.006646,0.043160,0.056110,0.043670,0.039177,-0.032154,0.064768,-0.237801,0.062368,0.099291,0.013760,-0.042481,-0.028948,0.054064,0.004533,-0.045083,0.087741,0.008087,0.041601,0.006005,-0.008495,-0.048352,-0.029840,-0.028602,-0.000468,0.018941,-0.002260,-0.027463,0.004261,-0.010445,-0.051239,-0.009391,-0.059288,0.028806,0.030570,0.025918,-0.041016,-0.060484,0.007087,-0.056147,0.014797,0.065473,-0.021772,0.007775,0.242316,-0.096757,-0.011602,-0.041473,-0.016075,-0.012897,-0.017393,-0.034222,-0.052539,-0.010457,0.019357,0.048315,-0.025863,0.009071,-0.012486,0.017551,-0.049426,0.097477,0.001995,-0.062129,0.008026,-0.000527,0.058381,0.038551,-0.001097,0.093686,-0.034796,0.020115,0.113496,0.009652,0.010676,0.040550,-0.063190,-0.028913,-0.025729,0.016566,0.001486,0.027262,-0.010107,0.017132,-0.012755,-0.017903,-0.079026,0.032556,-0.104021,-0.020712,0.094399,-0.006165,0.026285,-0.048392,-0.031145,-0.048837,0.066635,-0.038553,-0.012789,0.049625,0.055510,-0.005640,0.060098,0.015396,0.011145,0.008508,-0.039919,0.006068,0.108822,0.015307,-0.034758,-0.045669,-0.000559,-0.004301,0.004906,-0.002491,0.0242