insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$rainfall_variability_climate_change.txt$kc$, $kc$For planting decisions, farmers traditionally use the onset of the monsoon as a key signal. The date of reliable monsoon onset has become harder to predict due to higher interannual variability and changes in the large-scale circulation patterns (like the Madden-Julian Oscillation) that influence Indian monsoon dynamics. False onset events — brief early rains followed by a dry spell — cause significant losses when farmers sow too early based on the initial rains and their seedlings die.

Rainfall variability affects crop choice: in years with predicted below-normal monsoon (signalled by La Niña-to-El Niño transitions or Indian Ocean Dipole patterns), farmers in dryland areas often shift toward drought-tolerant crops like pearl millet, sorghum, or pulses rather than water-intensive paddy. This adaptive behaviour, while rational, can reduce food production of staple cereals.$kc$, '[-0.049884,-0.004345,0.000342,0.020266,0.074810,-0.007482,0.026615,0.009901,0.009328,-0.007115,0.024835,-0.040359,0.044913,0.025868,-0.009367,0.015622,0.007073,0.004478,-0.024457,0.023427,0.068865,0.032544,-0.045654,-0.070174,0.036157,0.021290,-0.018889,0.011568,-0.051904,-0.184509,0.019303,-0.018338,0.021662,0.000371,-0.055667,-0.007752,-0.014916,0.042248,0.013295,0.017494,0.017465,0.018561,0.009216,-0.059069,-0.095778,-0.058497,-0.005110,0.015336,0.004241,-0.057869,0.002065,-0.020571,-0.000578,-0.002287,0.041569,0.017217,0.053340,0.054056,0.035005,0.013153,0.016324,0.037002,-0.228258,0.067598,0.039345,0.011290,-0.018768,-0.003570,0.046920,0.025405,-0.020663,0.075479,-0.002124,0.019383,0.021517,-0.018058,-0.033043,-0.019971,-0.029388,0.031550,0.038125,0.006441,-0.066780,-0.015883,-0.035429,-0.054878,0.021786,-0.059031,0.059861,-0.036252,-0.022360,-0.048472,-0.064005,0.021943,-0.073991,0.037828,0.033369,-0.015151,-0.056415,0.262991,-0.074582,0.018104,-0.006812,0.042367,-0.004738,-0.059224,-0.056623,-0.042651,0.011844,0.036959,-0.003809,0.019416,0.013776,-0.001019,-0.011672,-0.038658,0.026418,0.017398,0.013993,0.006120,0.008842,0.082167,0.034829,-0.002764,0.021720,-0.062088,0.037921,0.110801,-0.018985,-0.037202,0.051585,-0.067538,-0.069221,-0.017918,-0.005718,0.031315,0.039987,0.013397,0.012122,-0.041692,-0.038818,-0.052791,0.020168,-0.107908,-0.033535,0.108551,-0.005465,0.010105,-0.015685,-0.019793,-0.036083,0.030221,-0.018751,-0.025683,0.042404,0.070541,-0.019989,0.073961,-0.001567,-0.010350,-0.038045,-0.019048,-0.038256,0.078298,0.020506,-0.052773,-0.022115,0.023315,0.0120