insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$rainfall_variability_climate_change.txt$kc$, $kc$In irrigated areas, groundwater drawdown is accelerating in regions like Punjab and Haryana due to water-intensive paddy cultivation combined with reduced monsoon recharge. Climate projections suggest both glacial melt-fed river systems (used for canal irrigation) and monsoon recharge zones face disruption, creating medium-term water availability risk even where infrastructure currently exists.

Long-term planning implications include shifting crop calendars by 1–3 weeks in many South Asian regions, greater use of short-duration varieties that compress the growing period into lower-risk months, and integration of seasonal weather forecasts into district-level agricultural advisories.$kc$, '[-0.016965,-0.025847,0.030649,0.024336,0.009884,-0.015549,0.038221,0.013778,-0.015416,0.007531,0.028513,-0.077877,0.084979,0.025481,0.020754,-0.003662,-0.005516,0.024767,0.015637,-0.000268,0.081049,0.019609,0.006894,-0.089421,0.034738,0.042658,0.022306,-0.034906,-0.052841,-0.203391,0.015617,-0.022212,-0.012339,-0.009131,-0.027692,-0.020912,-0.029247,0.069742,-0.006367,0.029434,-0.023411,0.022195,0.007287,-0.055722,-0.076331,-0.022256,-0.042387,0.011500,0.021490,-0.033258,0.053359,-0.041408,0.025435,0.039419,-0.004295,0.001716,0.062388,0.053065,0.068998,0.047573,0.042637,0.018738,-0.199105,0.056646,0.018875,0.012031,-0.038656,-0.004152,0.053242,-0.011892,-0.051941,0.090127,-0.009422,0.012963,0.015044,-0.032080,-0.027541,-0.000716,-0.001367,0.012451,0.044318,-0.022314,-0.032904,-0.061082,-0.012788,-0.049913,-0.027381,-0.055188,0.064168,-0.005029,-0.011219,-0.049427,-0.020018,0.005643,-0.059270,0.019935,0.014501,-0.002106,-0.088093,0.231172,-0.064515,0.058747,0.014846,0.045992,0.015488,-0.034341,-0.048943,-0.011274,-0.002734,0.012101,0.008905,-0.030975,0.035903,-0.025727,0.016086,-0.003648,0.063018,0.019370,-0.043962,0.028484,-0.041298,0.061675,0.049409,0.013311,0.030054,-0.032279,0.054341,0.110519,0.019898,0.017159,0.060948,-0.051055,-0.041972,-0.041031,-0.006270,0.005237,0.023827,-0.052753,0.013209,-0.046466,-0.043790,-0.077616,0.022791,-0.113565,-0.021579,0.125969,-0.007995,0.029052,-0.024006,-0.014957,-0.041485,0.031537,0.012944,-0.002176,0.077575,0.034136,0.010847,0.045892,-0.002238,-0.011605,-0.036833,-0.043773,-0.078064,0.106995,0.030679,-0.057376,-0.014438,0.003002,0.015485,0.015366,0.029591,0.018909,0.045107,-0.038968,0.080483,-0.004053,-0.077954,0.012503,0.033858,-