insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$who_air_quality_guidelines.txt$kc$, $kc$Reference: WHO Global Air Quality Guidelines 2021 (WHO/EURO:2021-4436-43576-61371)

The World Health Organization published updated air quality guidelines in 2021 that significantly tightened previous thresholds, reflecting the growing body of evidence linking air pollution to cardiovascular and respiratory disease even at lower concentrations than previously assumed.

For fine particulate matter (PM2.5), WHO recommends an annual mean concentration not exceeding 5 µg/m³ and a 24-hour mean not exceeding 15 µg/m³. These values are stricter than the previous 2005 guidelines of 10 µg/m³ annual and 25 µg/m³ daily. PM2.5 particles penetrate deep into the lung alveoli and can enter the bloodstream, causing systemic inflammation.$kc$, '[-0.031492,-0.011024,0.076124,-0.000294,0.026777,0.034861,0.032512,0.056739,0.003461,0.014992,0.002689,-0.087058,0.027322,0.055393,-0.018690,0.003623,0.042769,-0.021924,-0.093563,0.029976,0.056662,0.038506,0.012270,-0.053168,0.012774,0.037873,-0.030929,-0.034502,-0.047149,-0.199016,-0.042970,-0.066020,0.009069,-0.007893,-0.018839,-0.049782,-0.022365,0.022781,-0.024044,0.063339,0.037943,-0.011636,0.015929,-0.059631,-0.036880,-0.038655,-0.033686,-0.005680,0.023114,-0.056865,0.029886,-0.006041,-0.017405,0.066974,-0.006512,-0.018171,0.047547,0.010665,0.061469,0.026194,0.013772,0.058931,-0.230618,0.069686,0.064269,0.035823,-0.038216,0.015126,0.013160,0.006494,-0.025287,-0.005461,0.009277,0.028053,0.020408,0.011294,-0.045212,-0.056254,0.043413,-0.002546,0.006146,-0.005449,-0.034356,-0.034968,-0.000286,-0.050157,-0.001829,-0.065165,0.004269,0.006116,-0.031944,-0.048186,-0.039553,0.067317,-0.050616,-0.006634,0.051269,0.006759,-0.063074,0.207945,-0.053608,-0.005179,-0.009520,0.020950,0.008996,-0.035362,-0.014818,-0.039415,0.018466,0.003410,0.020702,-0.023703,0.093152,-0.040623,-0.000356,0.045409,0.058226,0.003852,-0.024452,0.019752,-0.024956,-0.034232,0.046964,-0.000174,0.071456,0.001528,0.039542,0.096530,0.029592,0.058834,0.075958,-0.028451,-0.048273,-0.017582,0.015515,-0.020338,0.026241,0.010454,0.037408,0.004252,-0.020783,-0.077824,0.003467,-0.122754,-0.033793,0.134857,-0.038214,0.045833,-0.035719,-0.068192,-0.012350,0.034561,-0.046864,0.002343,0.033499,0.035600,0.035636,0.047831,0.005619,0.012679,-0.014522,-0.078799,-0.072660,0.096227,0.004088,-0.019235,-0.066680,0.023456,0.027727,-0.001559,0.024606,0.019856,-0.