insert into knowledge_chunks (source_file, content, embedding) values ($kc$who_air_quality_guidelines.txt$kc$, $kc$For coarse particulate matter (PM10), the recommended limits are 15 µg/m³ annual mean and 45 µg/m³ 24-hour mean. These represent a 50% reduction from the 2005 limits of 20 µg/m³ and 50 µg/m³ respectively.

For nitrogen dioxide (NO2), the annual guideline is 10 µg/m³ and the 24-hour mean is 25 µg/m³. NO2 is a primary pollutant emitted by combustion engines and industrial sources. Chronic exposure causes airways to become inflamed and increases susceptibility to respiratory infections.

For ground-level ozone (O3), WHO recommends a peak season mean of 60 µg/m³ (approximately 8-hour maximum daily average). Ozone is a secondary pollutant formed by photochemical reactions between NOx and volatile organic compounds in sunlight.$kc$, '[-0.031682,-0.012203,0.051031,-0.012903,0.058023,0.036095,0.059080,0.046466,-0.014167,0.013484,-0.028584,-0.079402,0.038695,0.035695,0.018146,0.020448,0.020007,-0.014689,-0.051067,0.030133,0.091196,0.008437,-0.027192,-0.060748,0.031258,0.066820,-0.038134,-0.029825,-0.052318,-0.196325,-0.014318,-0.020460,0.041226,0.017446,-0.023665,-0.030772,-0.019095,0.034997,-0.007309,0.024754,0.048383,-0.001163,0.008525,-0.072977,-0.031049,-0.051752,-0.050411,-0.020455,0.031540,-0.084056,0.047134,-0.029452,-0.015891,0.072723,0.019069,0.003469,0.031296,0.000654,0.038870,-0.014094,0.001755,0.050739,-0.240053,0.021242,0.074409,0.048729,-0.043482,0.030839,0.025914,0.011919,-0.044661,0.013534,0.011461,0.042184,0.014832,0.032653,-0.035593,-0.038185,0.012112,-0.025653,-0.007110,-0.008665,-0.023866,-0.053595,0.001582,-0.037312,0.001194,-0.023767,0.010566,0.023751,-0.010874,-0.044613,-0.031644,0.009070,-0.034543,0.010319,0.034190,0.004618,-0.036593,0.226999,-0.043527,-0.016427,0.005093,-0.012025,0.008994,-0.044775,-0.022171,-0.032811,0.004174,0.033737,0.025110,-0.017298,0.062288,-0.054545,0.006342,0.034219,0.083992,0.013720,-0.033413,-0.004841,-0.006421,0.003382,0.042512,0.008931,0.066160,-0.044123,0.041704,0.099757,0.029200,0.053455,0.035051,-0.022187,-0.031566,-0.006501,-0.004963,-0.019299,0.027120,0.010584,0.010679,0.020411,-0.027933,-0.089701,-0.011887,-0.110808,-0.027295,0.133813,-0.034468,0.032187,-0.019391,-0.041684,-0.016131,0.044721,-0.045031,-0.039450,0.064847,0.031599,0.017251,0.035483,-0.013534,0.015325,-0.001168,-0.058256,-0.024364,0.089819,0.012550,-0.036831,-0.063029,0.051494,0.019377,-0.003929,0.028607,0.037602,-0.009627,-0.006246,0.101732,0.042504,-0.005002,0.061304,0.024934,0.041517,0.033207,-0.014698,-0.019934,0.032333,0.078388